---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Using My Photography"
  description="Copyright and permission information for photography by Ryan D. Lewis."
>
  <div class="page prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">Photography use</p>
    <h1>Using My Photography</h1>
    <p class="lede">Photographs on Red River Gorge Hiker are copyrighted by Ryan D. Lewis.</p>

    <section>
      <h2>Sharing the website</h2>
      <p>You are welcome to share links to RedRiverGorgeHiker.com or to individual photograph pages.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Reproducing a photograph</h2>
      <p>Please ask before copying or publishing a photograph for a website, article, advertisement, brochure, social-media post, video, product, or other use outside ordinary personal viewing.</p>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:Ryan@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com">Ryan@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com</a> with the photograph title and a short explanation of how you would like to use it.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Questions about a photograph</h2>
      <p>For questions about an image, its story, or possible use, contact Ryan directly by email. Permission is only granted when Ryan confirms it in writing.</p>
    </section>

    <p class="actions">
      <a class="button" href="mailto:Ryan@RedRiverGorgeHiker.com">Email Ryan</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
